  <item>
    <title>当年沉迷八卦的孩子们后来怎么了 | 关爱八卦成长协会十周年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6630624b48581314506a9126</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6630624b48581314506a9126</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Apr 2024 03:15:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新播客「经验碎片」正式上线，首播主题「当年沉迷八卦的孩子们后来怎么了」，共采访到十余位当年关八的观众，一起来聊聊过去十年间那些跟八卦和成长有关的故事。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🎙 本期主播:</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1679153295" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1679153295"><span>马睿马同学</span></a><span> 、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5314459224" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5314459224"><span>美工张铁牛</span></a><span>（微博、公众号同名）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>📌 经验碎片网友Call in版播客请关注「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6658697a8655d373eb156541" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6658697a8655d373eb156541"><span>奇妙故事局</span></a><span>」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📍 </span><strong><span>段落导航：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> VCR:你印象最深的一个八卦是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 赵丽颖王昊恋情曝光与后续🔥</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 香港艺人开发布会道歉背后的秘密🔥</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 范冰冰工作室改稿的故事🔥</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> VCR:你是从什么时候开始爱看八卦的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 八卦是人类本能，故事给人带来安全感</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 以艺人为主角的故事天然具有戏剧张力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> VCR:八卦对你的人生产生过哪些影响</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 粉丝私信轻生事件让会长关注情绪价值</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 被女明星叫老公是什么体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 因为「康熙」开启湖南广电职业生涯</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> VCR:过去十年八卦的心态有哪些变化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 总结陈词与节目预告</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🔗 </span><strong><span>节目里提及的内容链接：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.workstore.com.cn/album/23" data-url="https://www.workstore.com.cn/album/23"><span>专栏《疯狂的年代1:关八纪事》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.workstore.com.cn/album/62" data-url="https://www.workstore.com.cn/album/62"><span>专栏《疯狂的年代2:台湾娱乐史》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.workstore.com.cn/article/110" data-url="https://www.workstore.com.cn/article/110"><span>专题《冰冰传:一代女星上位传奇》</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
